  "description": "The Skycap eBike is the epitome of versatility and reliability, designed to be your trusty companion for all your hauling needs. With its extended tail and impressive payload capacity of 380lbs, the Skycap is ready to carry everything you need, wherever you go.\nFeatures:\n\nExtended Tail: Provides ample space for hauling precious cargo, making it perfect for errands or adventures.\n\nHigh Payload Capacity: With a total payload capacity of 380lbs, the Skycap can handle heavy loads with ease.\n\nVersatile Use: Ideal for commuting, running errands, or embarking on weekend adventures.\n\nSturdy Construction: Built to last with a sturdy frame and reliable components.\n\nPowerful Motor: Equipped with a powerful motor for smooth and efficient riding.\n\nSpacious Cargo Area: Plenty of room to carry groceries, gear, or even your furry friend.\n\nBenefits:\n\nEnjoy the freedom to haul whatever you need, wherever you go.\nMake every journey an unforgettable adventure with the Skycap eBike.\nNavigate city streets or country roads with confidence and ease.\nTrust in the durability and reliability of your Skycap eBike for years to come.\nExperience the joy of effortless, stylish biking while tackling life's everyday adventures.\n\nExperience the convenience and versatility of the Skycap eBike today. Elevate your hauling experience and make every ride a breeze.",
